{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">不知道大家有没有遇到过这种情况</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">快递已经寄走正在运输途中了</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">收件人却突然告知需要寄到另一个地址</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">或者原来的地址是错的</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">需要更换正确的地址寄送</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">通常，快递公司可以改一次地址</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">不支持多次修改</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">还会生成新的运单号</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">查询时要来回切换</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">还会遇到快递变慢、运费变高、</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">部分品类不支持修改的情况</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&hellip;&hellip;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 